git token.txt

# ── Auto-generated scan caches (rebuilt on each run) ──────────────────────────
# Patterns are path-agnostic so they survive the repo restructure.
scan_results.json
results.json
# Cadence/Coil shared grouped-daily bar cache (~50MB, dev-only, rebuilt in CI)
.cadence_cache/
# SEC Form 345 quarterly archives (~200MB, one-time backfill, dev-only —
# CI reuses the committed insider_history.json instead of re-downloading)
.insider_cache/
# list_backtest.py: git-history snapshots + daily price cache + miss ledger
.list_cache/
# GitHub Actions commits each dashboard's scan output — must not be ignored
!**/data/results.json

# ── Internal working notes (kept locally, not published) ──────────────────────
CONTEXT.md
PROGRESS.md
PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md
UPDATE_PLAN.md
MONETIZATION.md
INSPIRATION.md
EDITS.md
SITE_NAVIGATION.md
WRITING_STYLE.md

# ── Local-only working folders ────────────────────────────────────────────────
backup/
# A slash in the middle of a pattern anchors it to the repo root, so these use
# **/ to keep matching after the site folder becomes the root.
**/images/old/
**/images/source/
**/images/fromAI/
.claude/

# ── IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── Sibling projects — each lives in (or will get) its own repo, not this one ─
